
# RevenueGuard AI

Revenue Intelligence and Revenue Leakage Detection.

## Version
0.1 - Prototype

## Features
- Executive dashboard
- Transaction monitoring
- CSV upload
- Rule-based anomaly detection
- Revenue risk indicators
- Responsive interface

## Technology
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Netlify

## Deployment
Publish directory: .

Build command: None

## Current Limitations
This prototype uses browser-based rules.
It is not connected to a live ERP or accounting system.
All alerts require human validation.

## Roadmap
1. Validate business rules.
2. Connect authorized financial data.
3. Build secure backend.
4. Add AI-based anomaly detection.
5. Run a customer pilot.
